<title>UK: McBride leaps after Wassall builds stake.</title>
<headline>McBride leaps after Wassall builds stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in household products group McBride Plc jumped on Tuesday after the company said Wassall Plc had built up a 2.98 percent shareholding, dealers said.</p>
<p>McBride shares leapt 14p, about 11 percent, to 138-1/2p by 0743 GMT in volume of 317,000 shares. Shares in Wassall slipped half a penny to 327-1/2p.</p>
</text>
